= The ballot after the nominations close

The official ballot contains [? if pres_2025_united_left: twelve?][? if not
pres_2025_united_left: thirteen?] names in this timeline. Headquarters models
the five smallest committees together, but voters will see every candidate
separately. The aggregation is arithmetic, not a shared ideology.

