Every camera appearance treats Braun as proof of what Konfederacja always was.
The line satisfies anti-fascist organisers, but Mentzen answers with the image
of the man who imposed discipline while Braun tells supporters that the whole
system fears him. Both successor campaigns find a use for our simplification.

- @poland_event_queue: Record the unified attack

