not control the education ministry.?]

Teachers willing to run health classes, medical associations that can defend
the curriculum and parents who want their children included need a structure
that can outlast one press conference. We can prove the course locally, force
a defeated bill onto the record or build the coalition before asking it to
survive a PiS majority.

