subtitle: Narrow the suspension without endorsing it; refugee organisers will still record a retreat.
on-arrival: asylum_position_2025 = "Abstained after enforceable exceptions"; border_rights_standard += 3; constitutional_restraint += 3; ko_relation += 2; psl_relation += 1; progressives_dissent += 3; public_trust += 1; border_permission_pressure += 1; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 6; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 3; news_headline = "Humanitarian exceptions narrow the suspension"

Medical emergencies, children and access to judicial review are written into
the bill before Lewica abstains. Border services gain a narrower rule and the
coalition keeps enough votes. Refugee organisations acknowledge the openings
without calling a suspension humane merely because it has exceptions.

- @poland_event_queue: File the safeguarded abstention

@asylum_support
title: Support the government line as a response to Belarus
subtitle: Join the security consensus at the cost of owning the suspension before refugee advocates.
on-arrival: asylum_position_2025 = "Supported temporary asylum suspension"; border_doctrine = "Security consensus and asylum suspension"; border_security_confidence += 5; military_trust += 2; ko_relation += 4 if government_party = "ko"; pis_relation += 4 if government_party = "pis"; psl_relation += 3; refugee_empathy -= 6; minority_safety -= 4; razem_cooperation -= 6; far_right_agenda += 3; border_permission_pressure += 8; news_headline = "Lewica backs the government's asylum-suspension line"

