Kotula introduces a self-determination statute that replaces procedural mercy
with a uniform right. Trans organisations gain a bill around which to organise;
PSL and the Palace prepare to oppose its scope. The judgment is protected
politically, but no statute has yet passed.

- @poland_event_queue: File the national recognition bill

