= A debate season, not one clean confrontation

Końskie begins as a proposed duel and fills with candidates who refuse to wait
outside. An all-candidate studio then gives each campaign reciprocal questions
and a timed statement. The joint broadcasters close the sequence with equal
clocks, thematic blocks and nearly four hours in which one weak answer can
erase a week of campaigning.

[? if pres_2025_united_left: **[+ pres_2025_left_candidate +]** stands at the
only Left lectern. Razem organisers are part of the same campaign; there is no
second Zandberg candidacy.?][? if not pres_2025_united_left: **[+
pres_2025_left_candidate +]** and <span class="party-razem"><b>Adrian Zandberg</b></span> occupy separate lecterns.
Their overlap is now a political argument the audience can compare.?]

Pre-debate support for **[+ pres_2025_left_candidate +]**: **[+
pres_2025_poll_left +]%**.

