title: Debate I — security and foreign policy
new-page: true
on-arrival: public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 14; public_mood_pending_border_security_salience += 9

**[+ pres_2025_right_surname +]** promises a stronger national command; **[+
pres_2025_ko_surname +]** presents alliances and administrative competence;
**[+ pres_2025_konf_surname +]** says the existing parties spend before they
define a national interest. The
President commands the armed forces but does not write the budget alone. Our
first answer must show both resolve and restraint.

- @pres25_security_signature
- @pres25_security_law
- @pres25_security_hawk

