# prose-audit: Grade A — The seven-level verdict on Lewica's result is genuinely authored, and the inter-round bargain beneath it now matches: eight endorsement routes each report what was signed and what it cost, and they open a two-move support market over the electorates the first round left without a candidate.
title: Presidential election — first round
subtitle: [? if pres_2025_united_left: One Left campaign receives a national verdict?][? if not pres_2025_united_left: Two Left strategies receive separate verdicts?]
