= June 2025 — The cabinet has already fallen

President-elect **[+ pres_2025_winner +]** enters a capital where Prime
Minister **[+ prime_minister +]** already leads only a caretaker Council of
Ministers. Civil servants keep the state moving while party delegations search
for 231 votes; the outgoing cabinet cannot manufacture a fresh mandate by
asking Article 160 to reverse its fall.

[? if left_in_government: Our ministers retain their offices only for
continuity and cannot spend caretaker status as coalition leverage. Lewica's
real decision is which successor programme and prime minister it will support.?]
[? if not left_in_government: Lewica enters the formation talks from
opposition. The presidential result changes which bargains look credible, but
only a successor cabinet's investiture can end the caretaker period.?]

