- @formation_designation_2025: Ask the Palace to consider the replacement

@formation_designation_2025
# prose-audit: Grade C — The constitutional logic is exactly right and worth keeping, but the page is a dashboard: signed posture, projected supporters and PSL/Poland 2050/Centrum yes-no flags are printed as fields. The investiture roll call that follows even shows the player "the roll-call variance". The President's decision needs to be narrated, not tabulated.
title: The Palace decides whether to designate the proposed nominee
subtitle: Lewica proposes; the President independently uses the first Article 154 attempt
face-image: img/poland/events/presidential-palace.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.caretaker_government = 1;
Q.government_has_confidence = 0;
Q.coalition_broken = 1;
const total = Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460);
const currentPresident =
    typeof Q.president_name == "string" &&
    Q.president_name.length &&
    Q.president_name != "None"
        ? Q.president_name
        : "the serving President";
const proposedCandidate =
    typeof Q.formation_2025_candidate == "string" &&
    Q.formation_2025_candidate.length
        ? Q.formation_2025_candidate
        : (Q.ko_leader || "KO nominee");
Q.formation_2025_psl_committed =
    Number(Q.psl_seats) > 0 &&
    Number(Q.psl_relation) >= 35 &&
    Number(Q.psl_coalition_dissent) < 65 ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_2025_p2050_committed =
    Number(Q.p2050_seats) > 0 &&
    Number(Q.p2050_relation) >= 35 &&
    Number(Q.p2050_coalition_dissent) < 65 ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_2025_centrum_committed =
    Number(Q.centrum_seats) > 0 &&
    Number(Q.centrum_relation) >= 45 ? 1 : 0;
const partnerSeats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) +
    (Q.formation_2025_p2050_committed
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0)
        : 0) +
    (Q.formation_2025_centrum_committed
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.centrum_seats) || 0)
        : 0) +
    (Q.formation_2025_psl_committed
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0)
        : 0);
const pledgedLeft = Math.max(
    0,
    Number(Q.formation_2025_left_yes) || 0
);
const projectedSupport = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(total, Math.round(partnerSeats + pledgedLeft))
);
const palaceRelation = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(100, Number(Q.president_relation) || 0)
);
const continuity =
    proposedCandidate == String(Q.prime_minister || "");
const dudaCohabitation =
    currentPresident == "Andrzej Duda" &&
    Q.government_party != "pis";
const viabilityEffect = Math.max(
    -10,
    Math.min(
        12,
        Math.round((projectedSupport - 231) / 3)
    )
);
const relationEffect = Math.max(
    -8,
    Math.min(8, Math.round((palaceRelation - 40) / 5))
);
const continuityEffect = continuity ? 7 : -2;
const cohabitationEffect = dudaCohabitation ? -6 : 0;
const handoverEffect =
    Q.pres_2025_hostile_president ? -3 : 2;
Q.formation_2025_designation_president = currentPresident;
Q.formation_2025_designation_support = projectedSupport;
Q.formation_2025_designation_continuity = continuity ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_2025_designation_cohabitation =
    dudaCohabitation ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_2025_designation_score = Math.max(
    25,
    Math.min(
        80,
        54 +
            viabilityEffect +
            relationEffect +
            continuityEffect +
            cohabitationEffect +
            handoverEffect
    )
);
Q.formation_2025_designation_roll =
    Math.floor((this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 21) - 10;
Q.formation_2025_designation_total = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        100,
        Q.formation_2025_designation_score +
            Q.formation_2025_designation_roll
    )
);
Q.formation_2025_designation_accepted =
    Q.formation_2025_designation_total >= 50 ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_2025_designation_outcome =
    Q.formation_2025_designation_accepted
        ? "The President designates the proposed cabinet"
        : "The President declines the proposal and exhausts the first route";
Q.confidence_mode =
    "Article 154(1) — Palace designation decision";
Q.confidence_candidate = proposedCandidate;
Q.news_headline = Q.formation_2025_designation_outcome;
!}

= July 2025 — A proposal is not a presidential act

We and our prospective partners propose **[+ formation_2025_candidate +]**.
That is a negotiating preference, not the constitutional choice of **[+
formation_2025_designation_president +]**.

Our signed posture is **[+ formation_2025_mode +]**: **[+
formation_2025_left_yes +] yes**, **[+ formation_2025_left_no +] no** and **[+
formation_2025_left_abstain +] abstentions**.

The Palace weighs a projected **[+ formation_2025_designation_support +]**
supporters, its relationship with the current President, cabinet continuity
and the cohabitation and handover climate.

Partner commitments: **PSL [? if formation_2025_psl_committed: yes?][? if not
formation_2025_psl_committed: no?] · Poland 2050 [? if
formation_2025_p2050_committed: yes?][? if not
formation_2025_p2050_committed: no?] · Centrum [? if
formation_2025_centrum_committed: yes?][? if not
formation_2025_centrum_committed: no?]**. Existing seats are not consent.

[? if formation_2025_designation_continuity: The proposal retains the
caretaker prime minister, giving the Palace a continuity argument.?]
[? if not formation_2025_designation_continuity: The proposal replaces the
caretaker prime minister and receives no continuity advantage.?]
[? if formation_2025_designation_cohabitation: **[+
formation_2025_designation_president +]** remains President until
the August handover, so a non-PiS proposal is judged inside hostile
cohabitation.?]

[? if formation_2025_designation_accepted: **The President designates [+
formation_2025_candidate +].** The Palace accepts that the pledged parties are
credible enough to face the chamber, without certifying that their MPs will
hold at investiture.?]
[? if not formation_2025_designation_accepted: **The President refuses our
proposal.** Hostile cohabitation, uncertain partners or a break with continuity
outweigh the seats we put on paper; initiative now passes to the Sejm.?]

- @formation_palace_accept_2025
- @formation_palace_refuse_2025

