Government lawyers send the pending court bill and appointment papers through
Hołownia's disputed office. Ministries receive signatures; courts immediately
freeze their effect, civil servants demand indemnities and **[+
pres_2025_right_surname +]** announces
that every act will be challenged on his first day.

The government has briefly done the unspecified thing for which the delay was
supposed to create time. It has not made any policy durable. Coalition
defections and allied pressure now make the oath unavoidable while leaving a
second archive of contested appointments inside the state.

- @poland_event_queue: Let the certified result close the acting window

