[? if left_in_government: Warning systems, shelters and municipal response
plans enter the same package as air defence. Eastern residents gain something
they can practise before the next alarm, although the civilian layer consumes
money the coalition had assigned elsewhere.?][? if not left_in_government:
Lewica funds municipal readiness audits and tables the gaps as a national bill.
Mayors gain evidence and a common demand; the government still controls actual
procurement and implementation.?]

