@drones_restraint
title: Demand verification before every escalation claim
subtitle: Keep rumour out of escalation decisions and risk appearing doubtful in the first hours of a breach.
on-arrival: constitutional_restraint += 3; military_trust -= 2; public_trust += 1; war_escalation_risk -= 4; pis_relation -= 2; news_headline = "Verification and de-escalation remain part of the security doctrine"

Lewica demands the flight paths, debris analysis and allied assessment before
each claim becomes an escalation. The rule protects the public from rumour and
forces ministers to show their evidence. Commanders and PiS accuse us of
turning the first hours of a breach into a seminar on doubt.

- @poland_event_queue: Record the verification doctrine

