Lewica lawyers publish sample registry forms for willing councils and finance the first
challenges to refusal. Couples gain a usable argument and local officials gain
cover to comply. The ministries still own national administration, so every
success also documents the executive guidance they have failed to issue.

- @poland_event_queue: Send the opposition registry model to the desk

