= December 2025 — Enforcement after enactment

The new law creates rules for registering and promoting collective agreements.
Labour Minister **[+ labor_minister +]** of **[+ labor_minister_party +]** now
faces the part no enactment photograph can perform: helping OPZZ, Solidarność
and other unions organise agreements that employers will sign and procurement
offices will reward.

[? if left_in_government: Lewica can fund registration support, organisers and
public-contract clauses from inside government.?][? if not left_in_government:
The ministry owns enforcement. Lewica can fund union support and expose weak
implementation, but it cannot spend the state reserve or command procurement.?]
The alternative is to claim a labour institution before it covers another
workplace.

