@nawrocki_apartment_2025
# prose-audit: Grade C — The transaction, the pensioner and the campaign arithmetic are all present with three distinct Lewica lines; the man who sold the flat is described rather than heard.
title: The candidate, the flat and the pensioner
subtitle: A property transaction becomes the right's credibility test days before the first round
face-image: img/poland/events/pres-candidate-nawrocki.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 46
order: 5
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2025 and month = 5 and pres_2025_round_one_done = 0 and nawrocki_apartment_2025_done = 0 and pres_2025_right_candidate = "Karol Nawrocki"
on-arrival: {!
Q.nawrocki_apartment_2025_done = 1;
Q.pres_2025_right_credibility_hit = 1;
Q.institutional_issue_salience =
    (Number(Q.institutional_issue_salience) || 0) + 2;
